## Common Time Complexities

| Notation | Name | Typical Example |
|---|---|---|
| O(1) | Constant | Array index lookup |
| O(log n) | Logarithmic | Binary search in sorted array |
| O(n) | Linear | Finding min/max in unsorted list |
| O(n log n) | Linearithmic | Merge sort, Quick sort (average) |
| O(n²) | Quadratic | Nested loop bubble sort |

## Key Architectural Principles

1. **Separation of Concerns:** Keep presentation, business logic, and data storage distinct.
2. **KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid):** Avoid premature optimization.
3. **DRY (Don't Repeat Yourself):** Abstract common logic into reusable modules.

```typescript
// Binary search implementation example in TypeScript
function binarySearch(arr: number[], target: number): number {
  let left = 0;
  let right = arr.length - 1;
  while (left <= right) {
    const mid = Math.floor((left + right) / 2);
    if (arr[mid] === target) return mid;
    if (arr[mid] < target) left = mid + 1;
    else right = mid - 1;
  }
  return -1;
}
```
